        "FS1001": {
          "id": "FS1001",
          "shortDescription": "Do not create a FunnySharp carrier with default or new()",
          "fullDescription": "Result<TValue, TError>, UnitResult<TError>, Validation<TValue, TError>, NonEmpty<T>, Effect<T>, Effect<TEnvironment, T>, Lens<TSource, TFocus>, and Optional<TSource, TFocus> are uninitialized in their default state, and every member that reads them throws InvalidOperationException. Use the factories (Success/Failure, Valid/Invalid, ToNonEmptyOrNone, the Effect factories, Create) instead. Option<T> (default is None) and TransitionResult (default is Undefined) are excluded because their defaults are valid.",
